{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/6b48ec846c816b7f112f4029041191f2.avif?t=1755992209\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You\u2019re not solving the mystery... you\u2019re reliving it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Artifact Protocol</i> is a psychological horror experience where every artifact holds the final moments of someone\u2019s life and you\u2019re forced to live through them for &quot;research&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Anthony</strong>, a wrongly imprisoned ex-soldier, promised freedom if he can survive a classified testing program. One by one, you're sent into the memories of the dead, reconstructed through five haunting artifacts. Each trial traps you in a different nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something's wrong. The further you go, the less you\u2019re sure whose memories you\u2019re inside, your own... or theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Unique Artifact Trials</strong>: Each with their own location, monster, story and psychological theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Learn each victim\u2019s story through living it... not just cutscenes or voice overs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Monster AI</strong>: Each Monster reacts/works differently in every trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Gamemodes: </strong>(Unlocked after game completion)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Mode: </strong>Features a <strong>new</strong> &quot;Observer&quot; and <strong>exclusive</strong> narrative voice lines, revealing <strong>hidden story layers</strong> unlocked after completing the main game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEMES &amp; TONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Artifact Protocol</i> focuses on dread, loss, and identity. Expect creeping fear, emotional weight, and lingering questions long after you shut the game down.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763740?t=1755992209","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/88e3287bae83f5c7792be9cce165e6e614643512/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755992209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/a932307361c6370a4bb95273c98bf2ed84c2cad3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755992209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/a932307361c6370a4bb95273c98bf2ed84c2cad3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755992209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Artifact Protocol is a psychological horror experience with unsettling environments, tense encounters, and occasional depictions of blood and violence. Its story explores themes of trauma, loss, and survival under extreme circumstances. Mature themes are presented in context and are not the game\u2019s focus. There is no sexual content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/6b48ec846c816b7f112f4029041191f2.avif?t=1755992209\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You\u2019re not solving the mystery... you\u2019re reliving it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Artifact Protocol</i> is a psychological horror experience where every artifact holds the final moments of someone\u2019s life and you\u2019re forced to live through them for &quot;research&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Anthony</strong>, a wrongly imprisoned ex-soldier, promised freedom if he can survive a classified testing program. One by one, you're sent into the memories of the dead, reconstructed through five haunting artifacts. Each trial traps you in a different nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something's wrong. The further you go, the less you\u2019re sure whose memories you\u2019re inside, your own... or theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Unique Artifact Trials</strong>: Each with their own location, monster, story and psychological theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Learn each victim\u2019s story through living it... not just cutscenes or voice overs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Monster AI</strong>: Each Monster reacts/works differently in every trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Gamemodes: </strong>(Unlocked after game completion)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Mode: </strong>Features a <strong>new</strong> &quot;Observer&quot; and <strong>exclusive</strong> narrative voice lines, revealing <strong>hidden story layers</strong> unlocked after completing the main game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEMES &amp; TONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Artifact Protocol</i> focuses on dread, loss, and identity. Expect creeping fear, emotional weight, and lingering questions long after you shut the game down.</p>","developers":["Liam Butler"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/d36bc0a27362a180445624be5d940aa6a6aa829f/header.jpg?t=1755992209","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257179451,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179451/movie480.mp4?t=1755104846","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179451/movie_max.mp4?t=1755104846"},"name":"Official Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179451/dd2684fc74cc0957a1cd1867369d0450b179fadb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755104846","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179451/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755104846","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179451/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755104846"}}],"name":"The Artifact Protocol","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-9100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD RX 560 (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Liam Butler"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria"